    rdawd:P10219 "1986-08" ;
    rdawd:P10330 "SFE says \"1986; with 1 story added, coll 1989 dos [i. e. the Tor Double with UKLG's The New Atlantis which also contained Return from the Rainbow Bridge] - a later but lesser magazine version won the 1987 Nebula.\"\nIn fact there are at least three versions:\nThe original text, which was printed by Cheap Street. (1986)\nThe magazine version, which strips out the details and framework of Desargues' theorem, which in the Cheap Street version introduces the various sections of the story. (1987)\nThe version printed in the Tor Double, which restores (and sometimes revises) the Desargues' theorem framework, and also expands upon the original Cheap Street text. (1989)" ;
    entedit:P01 vtp:V1000 ;
    entedit:P02 ntsf:157 ;
    rdawo:P10061 per:49 .

