        "https://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?63478" ;
    rdawd:P10223 "Roommates"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Roommates (Harrison, Harry)" ;
    rdawd:P10219 "1971-11" ;
    rdawd:P10330 "Harrison explains the origins of \"Roommates\" in the 1976 story introduction in \"The Best of Harry Harrison\". He states that \"Roommates\" was based upon the ideas and themes found in his 1966 novel \"Make Room! Make Room!\" but was rewritten almost completely for \"Roommates\"." ;
