    rdawd:P10219 "1833-10-10" ;
    rdawd:P10330 "Available on page 326, Bleiler (Gernsback).\nA man takes passage on a sailing vessel which encounters a terrible storm, and when it is rammed by a mysterious gigantic ship he boards it, to find that the crew seem to be ancient, enchanted, and haunted and pay him no attention whatsoever as they pursue their unknown goal.",
        "First published in October 19, 1833 Baltimore Sunday Visiter.\nSee the notes here and this OCR scan.\nAmazing Stories, March 1934. B (G) states first publication date as 10 October 1833 in Baltimore Sunday Visiter. $50.00 prize winner first story. Minimal S-F elements with the ending suggesting Hollow Earth concepts.\n4,156 words" ;
