    rdawd:P10219 "1906" ;
    rdawd:P10330 "While studying for an exam late one night, a student receives a visit from an old friend. He is surprised to see that the friend, who hails from a wealthy family, appears ragged and starved, and does not say a word as he eats the proffered food and stumbles into bed. In the morning the student can hear his friend's deep breathing, but cannot find the man's body anywhere." ;
