    rdawd:P10219 "1960" ;
    rdawd:P10330 "Celebrated spaceman and his crew, lately without work as planets were conquered, are sent on a thousand-year expedition to meet aliens who makes stars go nova in their trail. They explain they just travelled to find mankind's answers to \"pricipal questions of life\"; are disappointed by an unbelieving assistant's gung-ho actions and continue elsewhere. Back on Earth, thoroughly unheroic now, his feats are forgotten but his son, a blind composer cared for by his wife both of whom he had neglected, became famous posthumously.",
