wrk:1427954
    a rdac:C10001 ;
    rdaxd:P00018 "http://entedit.org/work/1427954",
        "https://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?1427954" ;
    rdawd:P10223 "Upír po dvaceti letech"@cs ;
    rdfs:label "Upír po dvaceti letech (Nesvadba, Josef)" ;
    rdawd:P10219 "1975-07-02" ;
    rdawd:P10330 "Narrator nearing 50th birthday who published \"Vampire Ltd\" 15 years ago is told a story where such blood-sucking racecar really appeared to exist, to be revealed as advertising stunt; then ponders on what it is to be aging writer.",
        "First in Tvorba weekly 27/1975 (monthly supplement LUK no. 7), with added subtitle \"(Závody se smrtí)\" (Races with Death). After the film's release Tvorba (or semi-independent weekly supplement Kmen, theme issue on SF) 26/1982 republished it, subtitle-less.\nOnly book pub (it was left out even from Nesvadba's 2010 nominally collected stories Erosomy) is 1983 anth Lidé ze souhvězdí Lva, subtitled \"(Upír z Feratu)\" (Vampire from Ferat) after the film's title. The film gives the story as the source and the inner plot agrees in main points; it was shot in 1981 and reportedly prepared in late 1970es." ;
    entedit:P01 vtp:V1000 ;
    entedit:P02 entedit:T02 ;
    rdawo:P10061 per:1722 .

