    rdawd:P10219 "1974" ;
    rdawd:P10330 "Society has become very rigid with punishment meted out for the slightest infraction. A common punishment is to turn a person, cat or dog into a \"pillar\" that's rooted into the ground. The person is still alive but soon changes into a plant." ;
