    rdawd:P10219 "1973" ;
    rdawd:P10330 "The narrator, a biologist, is told by his colleague Kovář about his unnerving discovery that several species with extraordinary properties have right-wing chirality, seeming not to be of this Earth. He is enlisted for further research which runs into some blind alleys but then Kovář finds scorpions and algae resistant to radioactivity. Promptly he dies, irradiated by the narrator who turns out to be an android from a planet preparing invasion of Earth.",
