    rdawd:P10330 "A prose poem per the editors of The Big Book of Modern Fantasy, though (per the Yiddish Book Center), the author described it as \"kurtse bashraybung\", which might be referring to \"the Yiddish lit genre known as miniaturn (miniatures)\". It is classified as SHORTFICTION on ISFDB as it is much more prose than poem.\nTitle and author name are per the Yiddish Book Center in Amherst, Massachusetts." ;
